{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1177209-a-mage-and-changeling-larp-near-barcelona-spain","id":1177209,"title":"A Mage and Changeling LARP near Barcelona Spain","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-19T02:27:12-08:00","id":1177209,"title":"A Mage and Changeling LARP near Barcelona Spain","content":"Hey everybody,<br /> <br /> I\u2019m a German guy living in Barcelona. We dispose of a land house nearby with quite some land surrounding it. I am working as a therapist and I have always been intrigued by the cathartic effect of theatre. I also remember a boy scout camp when I was little, where we organized a fairy forest game in the woods with different stations where dressed up friends prepared challenges for the different groups passing by. Finally we all gathered in a torch lid clearing and had meal together. That memory is very magical to me. I also was introduced to PnP on a boy scout hike, so landscape and imagination have always been for me in a way interwoven.<br /> In my opinion the World of Darkness Systems are a great achievement that not only brings a literary dimension to RPGs but they also open up spaces of shared imagination that are grounded in existential human experience. I am especially interested in Changeling and Mage with their themes of trauma, abuse, escapism on one hand and in the case of Mage of platonic philosophy and creativity.<br /> I would love to hear from you, if you are interested in organizing with me a LARP event on our land centering around those systems.<br /> I think that we could provide a really fun experience and it would be so nice to get to know you people to bounce ideas back and forth with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23717-helionomicon","name":"Helionomicon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T03:32:24-08:00","id":1177224,"title":"","content":"Man, if I weren't all the way to the other side of the north of Spain I would be glad to help with such an awesome project. Anyway I am glad to know that there are excellent people like you with great ideas like these, I wish you the best of lucks, you can do a lot of good with therapeutic role playing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-19T04:19:29-08:00","id":1177234,"title":"","content":"Dude, thanks for your approval. At least you're living in the same country. I think it's viable to plan the whole thing via Skype and then meet a few days before the LARP at our place to prepare everything. I do think Rpgs in themselves are therapeutic because they give room for communication and self-expression. I also think that in the worst case a therapeutic rpg could be as unattractive as an educational video game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I want the whole experience to be about having fun, but maybe for that it also has to be gripping and meaningful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23717-helionomicon","name":"Helionomicon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}